# git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# List of commit SHAs that `git blame` should skip. These are bulk
# mechanical commits (formatting, mass autofixes) whose diffs would
# otherwise attribute every touched line to the bot that ran the tool
# instead of the human who last changed the code's meaning.
#
# One SHA per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# Enable locally with:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub blames respect this file automatically when present at repo root.

